### How to Test

1. **Start IDP and SP Services**
   ```sh
   mvn spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.arguments="--server.port=8081" # IDP
   mvn spring-boot:run -Dspring-boot.run.arguments="--server.port=8082" # SP
   ```

2. **Generate SAML Assertion (IDP)**
   ```sh
   curl -X GET http://localhost:8081/idp/saml
   ```

3. **Validate SAML Assertion (SP) and Extract Custom Parameter**
   ```sh
   curl -X POST http://localhost:8082/sp/validate -d "{BASE64_SAML_ASSERTION}" -H "Content-Type: text/plain"
   ```

Now, the assertion includes a **custom parameter** (`CustomParam`), which is extracted and displayed on the SP side. 🚀
